            This enumeration is based on the IANA COSE Key Common Parameters registry.
            <para>
            https://www.iana.org/assignments/cose/cose.xhtml#key-type
            </para>
            </remarks>
            </summary>
        </member>
        <member name="F:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Cryptography.Cose.CoseKeyType.Unknown">
            <summary>
