            </summary>
        </member>
        <member name="F:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Cryptography.Cose.CoseKeyType.Symmetric">
            <summary>
            Symmetric keys
            </summary>
        </member>
        <member name="T:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Cryptography.CryptographicDefinitions">
            <summary>Immediately usable, immutable shared metadata for keys, curves and operations.</summary>
            <remarks>Describes structure, not hardware/provider support, protocol profiles or recommended choices.</remarks>
        </member>
        <member name="T:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Cryptography.CryptographicDefinitions.Algorithms">
            <summary>Useful SDK operation definitions, not an exhaustive registry or a choice of defaults.</summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Cryptography.CryptographicDefinitions.Algorithms.Ecdsa">
            <summary>Generic ECDSA on short-Weierstrass keys, with no hash selected.</summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Cryptography.CryptographicDefinitions.Algorithms.EcdsaSha1">
