        </member>
        <member name="F:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Native.Linux.Libc.NativeMethods.POLLPRI">
            <summary>There is urgent data to read (e.g., out-of-band data on TCP socket).</summary>
        </member>
        <member name="F:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Native.Linux.Libc.NativeMethods.POLLOUT">
            <summary>Writing is now possible.</summary>
        </member>
        <member name="F:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Native.Linux.Libc.NativeMethods.POLLERR">
            <summary>Error condition (only returned in revents; ignored in events).</summary>
        </member>
        <member name="F:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Native.Linux.Libc.NativeMethods.POLLHUP">
