            <summary>
            Wraps a synchronous HID feature report connection for OTP/Keyboard communication.
            Provides async interface for 8-byte OTP feature reports.
            </summary>
        </member>
        <member name="M:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Protocols.Otp.Hid.OtpHidConnection.#ctor(Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Transports.Hid.IHidConnection)">
            <summary>
            Wraps a synchronous HID feature report connection for OTP/Keyboard communication.
            Provides async interface for 8-byte OTP feature reports.
