        <member name="M:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Transports.Hid.Linux.ILinuxHidReadinessNative.ReadWake(Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Native.Linux.Libc.LinuxFileSafeHandle)">
            <summary>Attempts one eight-byte non-semaphore read to drain the wake counter; caller validates count and errno.</summary>
        </member>
        <member name="T:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Transports.Hid.Linux.LinuxHidReadinessNative">
            <summary>Production libc poll/eventfd adapter used by <see cref="T:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Transports.Hid.Linux.LinuxHidReadReactor"/>.</summary>
        </member>
        <member name="M:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Transports.Hid.Linux.LinuxHidReadinessNative.CreateWake">
