            <remarks>
            Does not schedule work, own a connection lifetime or enforce typed FIDO/OTP send lengths.
            Native framing is scoped and zeroed on every exit; caller storage remains caller-owned.
            See <see cref="T:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Transports.Hid.Linux.ILinuxHidReportApi"/> for blocking, sizing and checked-release contracts.
            </remarks>
        </member>
        <member name="P:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Transports.Hid.Linux.LinuxHidReportApi.Instance">
